<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Computer Parts Guide</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eef5ff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #2457a6;
        }

        .part {
            background: #f1f6ff;
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 5px solid #2457a6;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #2457a6;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🖥️ Computer Parts Guide</h1>

    <div class="part">
        <h2>CPU</h2>
        <p>The CPU processes instructions and performs calculations for the computer.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="part">
        <h2>RAM</h2>
        <p>RAM temporarily stores data that the computer is currently using.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="part">
        <h2>Storage</h2>
        <p>Storage devices such as SSDs and hard drives store files and programs.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="part">
        <h2>Motherboard</h2>
        <p>The motherboard connects important computer components together.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="part">
        <h2>Monitor</h2>
        <p>A monitor displays text, images, videos and other visual information.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="part">
        <h2>Keyboard and Mouse</h2>
        <p>These are input devices used to interact with the computer.</p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
